      "completeness": 5,
      "style_fit": 5
    },
    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Three distinct goblet designs share one atlas; each has a genuinely hollow bowl, confirmed in the top view where the copper interior is visible, and a properly closed foot in the bottom view. Engraved rim bands and turned stems read clearly in the orbit views. Wireframe shows clean lathe topology.",
    "limitations": [
      "Three goblets are supplied as one scene laid out side by side; separate them before use.",
      "Polished brass is highly reflective and will need an environment map to look right."
    ],
